'''People's Park''' ({{Langx|bl|Parc de Pueblo}}; {{Langx|mxi|خَارْدِينْ دِي بُوِيبْلُو|Jardíń de Pweblo}}) is a {{convert|20|acre|ha|adj=on}} [[W:Urban park|urban park]] in the [[Embajadores]] neighborhood of [[Expansión]], [[Castejón]]. People's Park emerged as a focal point of [[October 76|militant student activism]] of the [[Special Period]]. The park is an open space, dominated by the [[Arco de Humanidad]] at the northern gateway to the park, with a tradition of celebrating solidarity and public protest.

